msgid "Notes d’un médecin"
msgstr "Notes d’un médecin"

#: patterns/accueil-parution.php:27
msgid ""
"Vikenti Veressaïev, traduit du russe par Julie Bouvard, préface de Dimitri "
"Bortnikov"
msgstr ""
"Vikenty Veresaev, translated into French by Julie Bouvard, with a preface by"
" Dimitri Bortnikov"

#: patterns/accueil-parution.php:31
msgid ""
"Un jeune médecin raconte ses débuts à l’hôpital, ses doutes et ses erreurs. "
"À sa parution, en 1901, le livre fit scandale ; il n’a rien perdu de sa "
"franchise."
msgstr ""
"A young doctor recounts his first years at the hospital, his doubts and his "
"mistakes. The book caused a scandal when it came out in 1901; it has lost "
"none of its candour."

